The Simulation Hub is a place added on Update 29 that allows the player to access the [[Dungeon]]. It houses the [[Trinket Expert|Trinket]] [[Trinket Expert|Expert]] and [[Trinket Refiner|Trinket]] [[Trinket Refiner|Refiner]] [[NPCs]] who can upgrade, reforge, fuse or scrap the player's [[Trinkets]]. 

== Accessing ==
The Simulation Hub can be accessed via [[Lucien]], who is located on the left of the lab at [[Hot and Cold]] in [[Second Sea]], or next to the [[Mysterious Scientist]] in the [[Third Sea]]. The player can return by talking to the same [[NPCs|NPC]] in the Hub. The player can also access the Hub by pressing the [[Server Browser]] button at the top right corner and then pressing the [[Dungeons]] button.

== Design ==
The Simulation Hub is a large laboratory, with various mechanical devices on the floor along with some large vents and gears on the walls. There are various barrels and boxes stacked on the floor, and at the far end there are stiles that teleport 4 players at a time to the [[Dungeon]]. In front of the stiles is a large radio antenna underneath which the [[Trinket Expert]] and the [[Trinket Refiner]] are located.